2. **CORS Security Hardening**
   - Restricted `origin` from "allow any" to "allow trusted only"
   - Supports localhost (dev) + btcethdivergence.bryanlab.cc (prod)
   - Added 5 new CORS tests (allow/reject scenarios)
   - Fixes LOW #4

